{
    "title": "Symbiote Shooting Puzzle",
    "description": "Symbiote Shooting Puzzle: The Black Alien Hero is a puzzle shooting battle game where players must use their noggins and quick reflexes to defeat enemies and solve challenging battles. Playing as a powerful Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero in Symbiote Shooting Puzzle, you're equipped with the Symbiote's trusty shooting ability, allowing you to shoot symbiote tentacles and teleport to any location you've marked. Use The Black Alien Hero shooting skills strategically to move across the map, avoid obstacles, and dodge enemy attacks from various enemies and bosses.\r\n\r\nSymbiote Shooting Puzzle is a game puzzle battle action that will challenge your reflexes, creativity, powerful, and logic. Use Symbiote: The Black Alien Hero's tentacles strategically to solve challenges battles and reach new areas. Be careful because Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero will face hundreds of levels with different fighting and enemy attacks. The enemies in this world are not to be trifled with. They will attack you with everything they have, so Symbiote Hero needs to use powerful shooting skills to dodge enemies' strikes and defeat evil enemies before they harm you. Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero needs to be quick on his feet and strategic in his movements if you hope to make it to the end of each level battle.\r\n\r\nAs Symbiote Hero\u2019s superpowers progress through the game, you\u2019ll unlock new Symbiote Hero powers and skins to customize your hero, giving you more options for fighting and fun.\r\n\r\nSymbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero highlight features:\r\n\ud83e\ude78 Stunning mini craft pixel graphics, smooth animations, and realistic sound\r\n\ud83e\ude78 Fast-paced action with addictive fighting gameplay\r\n\ud83e\ude78 Dozens of Symbiote Hero's skins to unlock\r\n\ud83e\ude78 Challenging levels filled with tons of obstacles and enemies\r\n\r\nCan you master your powerful shooting skills and become the ultimate Symbiote Hero Venom? Only time will tell! Download Symbiote Shooting Puzzle now and experience the thrill of being a Symbiote Hero as known as Venom!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Symbiote Shooting Puzzle: The Black Alien Hero is a puzzle shooting battle game where players must use their noggins and quick reflexes to defeat enemies and solve challenging battles. Playing as a powerful Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero in Symbiote Shooting Puzzle, you&#39;re equipped with the Symbiote&#39;s trusty shooting ability, allowing you to shoot symbiote tentacles and teleport to any location you&#39;ve marked. Use The Black Alien Hero shooting skills strategically to move across the map, avoid obstacles, and dodge enemy attacks from various enemies and bosses.<br><br>Symbiote Shooting Puzzle is a game puzzle battle action that will challenge your reflexes, creativity, powerful, and logic. Use Symbiote: The Black Alien Hero&#39;s tentacles strategically to solve challenges battles and reach new areas. Be careful because Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero will face hundreds of levels with different fighting and enemy attacks. The enemies in this world are not to be trifled with. They will attack you with everything they have, so Symbiote Hero needs to use powerful shooting skills to dodge enemies&#39; strikes and defeat evil enemies before they harm you. Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero needs to be quick on his feet and strategic in his movements if you hope to make it to the end of each level battle.<br><br>As Symbiote Hero\u2019s superpowers progress through the game, you\u2019ll unlock new Symbiote Hero powers and skins to customize your hero, giving you more options for fighting and fun.<br><br>Symbiote Hero: The Black Alien Hero highlight features:<br>\ud83e\ude78 Stunning mini craft pixel graphics, smooth animations, and realistic sound<br>\ud83e\ude78 Fast-paced action with addictive fighting gameplay<br>\ud83e\ude78 Dozens of Symbiote Hero&#39;s skins to unlock<br>\ud83e\ude78 Challenging levels filled with tons of obstacles and enemies<br><br>Can you master your powerful shooting skills and become the ultimate Symbiote Hero Venom? Only time will tell! Download Symbiote Shooting Puzzle now and experience the thrill of being a Symbiote Hero as known as Venom!",
